1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,867
This spacecraft took eight years to reach Mercury.

2
00:00:04,533 --> 00:00:07,165
The hard part is slowing down.

3
00:00:07,783 --> 00:00:11,848
The Sun's gravity pulls it
inward, so it keeps speeding up.

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:15,705
But go too fast, and
you fly right past.

5
00:00:16,283 --> 00:00:18,101
So it swung by planets.

6
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:21,849
Earth once, Venus twice,
Mercury six times.

7
00:00:22,450 --> 00:00:26,436
After nine flybys, it
finally slipped into orbit.

8
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:30,143
But a software glitch cut
its engine burn short.

9
00:00:30,143 --> 00:00:31,595
It still made it.

10
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,907
Next, it splits
into two orbiters.

11
00:00:35,533 --> 00:00:37,716
The trick is slowing down.
